# ACPI hardware windows regression (tests/headless, acpi-hardware): stands
# in for acpi-backend.svc's launch (coordination/acpi-region-boundary.md).
# The startup plan approves its firmware snapshot reader and its hardware
# windows on one entry; the same image without the hardware approval must be
# refused at launch. "registers" is the role-35 client endpoint acpi.svc
# gets: optional here, badged with the frontend scope only when the entry
# approves (acpi-registers approve-declared).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi-hardware-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (Request.Firmware_Snapshot "tables")
    (Request.ACPI_Hardware "hardware")
    (service "acpi-registers" "registers")]
  optional => ["registers"])
